# Sample footage for the example workflows: 13 MB, and it is not covered by the licences in this
# repository (workflows/README.md says so). It has no business being pushed to everyone who
# installs the nodes through ComfyUI Manager. It stays in the GitHub repository, where anyone who
# wants to reproduce the examples can fetch it deliberately.
workflows/assets/

# README media: 12 MB of demo clips, and the READMEs reference them by absolute raw.githubusercontent
# URL, so the registry page renders them without the package having to carry them.
docs/media/
